  "identity": "THE BIG RIPPER: enormous swollen olive-green bog lord, almost spherical pot belly, tiny stubby legs and arms, comically small eyes under heavy green brow, broad little toothy mouth, tiny crooked gold crown and round gold belly medallion. Warty mossy hide and darker green-brown lower belly. No weapon, no armor, no pants. Use existing tiny green boss reference for anatomy, keep childish self-important grin.",
